/ActualText (Fig. 2. Wayfaring \(top\) and destination-oriented transport \(bottom\). Reproduced from Ingold, T. \(2007\), Lines: A Brief History, p. 101.)
/K [8]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 962 0 R
