/P 1374 0 R
>>
endobj
1384 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (This developed position brought the project closer to questions of co-presence rather than cooperation. Once the physical bus movement was removed and participants were given direct control over the handles, the interaction changed. The participants were no longer only bodies responding to an external environment; their actions began to constitute the environment experienced by others.)
/K [5]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 1385 0 R
/Pg 967 0 R
>>
