/ActualText (My initial research particularly focused on how synchronicity and bodily differences produce audible effects in the work, making Rocking Pipe Organ an important artistic reference during my early creative phase. This piece is made of three interconnected bellows chairs, requiring participants to coordinate their physical strength to produce harmonious sounds. But my installation work eventually took a different direction\024I no longer pursued unity and harmony, yet retained the mechanism of 'accidental resonance.')
