/ActualText (For the sensor component, I conducted material experiments. Initially, I attempted to manually craft textile strain sensors, drawing partial inspiration from Martinez Avila et al.'s \030The Stretchy Strap\031 project. Subsequently, I tried crocheting my own stretch sensors. However, the resistance values proved unstable, and the material's elasticity was limited, making these handmade textile sensors unsuitable for installation requirements.  \nTherefore, I shifted direction and used stretch rubber cord instead to prototype the sensor.)
/K [8]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 2840 0 R
/Pg 2230 0 R
>>
endobj
