/ActualText (After selecting the sensor, I designed a simple circuit to read the stretch-based input signal through the Bela board. Each sensor is connected to Bela's analog input through a voltage divider circuit using the sensor's built-in 10 k\251 resistor. Early testing was conducted on a breadboard, allowing for quick changes to connections and resistor values during the prototyping process.)
