/ActualText (The project subsequently expanded from a single-channel prototype to a three-channel system. At this stage, although the breadboard system is convenient for development, its stability is insufficient to meet the requirements of final installation. After stabilizing the circuit design, I re-soldered the connections on the circuit board to improve reliability and reduce the likelihood of loose connections during installation.)
/K [2]
/S /Span
