/ActualText (Structural development proceeded in parallel with the development of electronic components. In addition to sensing and audio systems, I also developed several solutions for mounting handrails. Early design proposals primarily focused on load-bearing capacity and how multiple participants could stand in front of a single wall-mounted handrail. Some of these designs offered stronger structural support but created difficulties for cable routing and electronic component installation \(Fig.21\02323\).\n\n)
