/ActualText (After discussing installation options with Owen, I initially considered using a simple sandwich-clamping structure to secure the suspended handrail. At this stage, key considerations included load capacity, suspension height, and how the structure would accommodate cabling. I also used visual planning images\024including AI-generated renderings of the installation\024to test how the structure would appear in space and to explore possible participant positions in front of it. These images were not records of the final product but rather part of the design process, helping me think through scale, spacing, and audience arrangement.\n\n)
