/ActualText (ChatGPT was used as a technical learning and debugging aid while I was developing the Bela and Pure Data system. I used it to help me understand Pure Data signal flow, sensor calibration, threshold logic, movement detection and audio mapping.\nRepresentative prompts included:\n \034I am using Pure Data and my patch currently looks like this. How should I connect it?\035\n \034Why does the sound continue after I release the sensor?\035\nThe responses were used as explanations and debugging guidance while I manually constructed and tested the Pure Data patch. I adjusted the sensor thresholds using analogue values measured from my own physical sensors and repeatedly tested the system on Bela.\nNo AI-generated Pure Data patch was used as the final submitted implementation. The final patch was manually assembled and modified by me in Pure Data based on my understanding of the signal flow and the results of physical testing.)
/K [6]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 4993 0 R
/Pg 4538 0 R
>>
endobj
