/ActualText (I also used ChatGPT to assist with structuring and refining the written documentation for this project. I provided my own proposal, development journal, research papers, technical notes, photographs and reflections, and used ChatGPT to help organise these materials and improve the clarity of the academic writing.\nRepresentative prompts included:\n \034Help me reorganise the Concept and Background Research section.\035\n \034How should I describe the conceptual shift from environmental agency to relationships between participants?\035\n \034Help me organise the Technical Implementation using my journal and process documentation.\035\n \034Help me format this Link in Harvard style.\035\nThe generated text was used as drafting and editing support. I reviewed, corrected and revised the outputs to reflect the actual conceptual and technical development of the project.)
